Protein name: Tumor suppresor P53
Organism: Homo sapiens
PDB ID: 1TUP
Experimental method (X-ray, Cryo-EM, NMR, etc.): X-ray diffraction 
Resolution (if available): 2.20 Å
Biological significance: maintains genomic stability (dna repair), monitoring of cell cycle, and triggers apoptosis if cell is beyond repair

